PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'form_of_power');
!}

= What Power Do We Want

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @parliamentarism
- @strong_presidency
- @workers_councils
- @easy_discard

@parliamentarism
title: Parliamentarism
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_parliamentarism_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_form_of_power +] ?][? if pl_stance_parliamentarism_present = 0 : The way of a majority in the Sejm and a government responsible before it. The Centre more readily follows our condemnation of political violence. Grows every month: parliamentarism. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'form_of_power', 'parliamentarism').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_parliamentarism_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'form_of_power', 'parliamentarism');
!}
go-to: result

@strong_presidency
title: A stronger presidency
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_strong_presidency_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_form_of_power +] ?][? if pl_stance_strong_presidency_present = 0 : Only with this line can PPS put forward the motion on presidential arbitration in the constitutional debate; a motion already put forward stays if the line changes later. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'form_of_power', 'strong_presidency').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_strong_presidency_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'form_of_power', 'strong_presidency');
!}
go-to: result

@workers_councils
title: Workers’ councils
subtitle: [? if pl_stance_workers_councils_present = 1 : **Present line** [+ pl_line_confirm_form_of_power +] ?][? if pl_stance_workers_councils_present = 0 : The first time, the Left of the party grows stronger and the Centre is displeased. The line alone brings no votes. Grows every month: radicalism. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'form_of_power', 'workers_councils').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_councils_why +]
